// Uses origin `RamzesX/chaos-shield` (verified via git remote).
// NOTE: The 14-cycle catalogue was shipped on the native ext4 working dir
// (~/lean-v2/) and syncs to this path on the next push.  For now individual
// Lean files are linked to the Predictions directory index so the link is
// never broken; files already pushed (NumericalFitsCycle9.lean, Cold-Neutron,
// DESI etc.) open directly.
